      "end_minus_years": 0,
      "end_plus_years": 0,
      "note": "The dates are the span of the reign as given by EBSCO (690 to 664 BCE) and BlackPast (ascended 690 B.C.E.; death 664 B.C.E.), astronomical -689 to -663. BlackPast also says the Kushites were forced out of Egypt by 656, which does not match its own death date; birth is unknown ('?')."
